spice
* NMOS Transistor M1
M1 3 1 2 2 NMOS

* NMOS Transistor M2
M2 5 4 2 2 NMOS

* Resistors
R1 Vin 1 R1_value
RD1 6 3 RD1_value
RD2 6 5 RD2_value
R2 2 0 R2_value
RS 2 0 RS_value

* Voltage Source
VDD 6 0 VDD_value

* Output
Vout 5 0

* Model Definitions
.model NMOS NMOS(...)  * specify NMOS parameters